        "\n",
        "## Part 4 — GSM A8: Session Key Generation\n",
        "\n",
        "### Learning Objectives\n",
        "\n",
        "After this experiment, students should be able to:\n",
        "\n",
        "- Explain the purpose of the GSM A8 algorithm.\n",
        "- Identify the inputs and output of A8.\n",
        "- Understand how the SIM and home network derive the same key.\n",
        "- Explain why RAND can be public while Ki must remain secret.\n",
        "- Understand how Kc is subsequently used for GSM encryption.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Background\n",
        "\n",
        "GSM uses two related security functions:\n",
        "\n",
        "**A3 — Subscriber Authentication**\n",
        "- Inputs: Ki and RAND\n",
        "- Output: SRES (32 bits)\n",
        "- Purpose: Authenticate the subscriber.\n",
        "\n",
        "**A8 — Session Key Generation**\n",
        "- Inputs: Ki and RAND\n",
        "- Output: Kc (64 bits)\n",
        "- Purpose: Generate the ciphering key for the GSM radio link.\n",
        "\n",
        "The SIM and the home network's Authentication Centre (AuC)\n",
        "possess the same long-term secret Ki.\n",
        "\n",
        "When both process the same RAND using the same A8 function,\n",
        "they derive the same Kc independently.\n",
        "\n",
        "The home network provides the generated Kc to the serving\n",
        "network through the GSM authentication infrastructure.\n",
        "\n",
        "The secret Ki does not need to be transmitted to the\n",
        "serving network.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Experiment\n",
        "\n",
        "We investigate three questions:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Do the SIM and network derive the same Kc?\n",
        "2. What happens when RAND changes?\n",
        "3. What happens when the secret Ki changes?\n",
        "\n",
        "### Important Technical Note\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook uses HMAC-SHA256 truncated to 64 bits as an\n",
        "educational substitute for A8.\n",
        "\n",
        "It is NOT the historical GSM COMP128 algorithm.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Discussion Questions\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Why can RAND be transmitted openly?\n",
        "2. Why must Ki remain secret?\n",
        "3. Does changing RAND change Kc?\n",
        "4. What happens if the SIM and network use different Ki values?\n",
        "5. What is the relationship between A8 and A5?\n"
      ]
    },
