        "### Visual Lab — Understanding A5/1 Majority Clocking\n",
        "\n",
        "#### Concept\n",
        "\n",
        "A5/1 contains three Linear Feedback Shift Registers (LFSRs):\n",
        "\n",
        "- R1: 19 bits\n",
        "- R2: 22 bits\n",
        "- R3: 23 bits\n",
        "\n",
        "Each register has a clock-control bit.\n",
